ng or if i come up with  anything i'll give you a call right i'll  i'll talk to you now one of the things  to know is that this is bruce wayne  being manipulative right he knows that  wong has information that he needs but  he knows that wong won't readily give it  to him because bruce wayne's not working  with her on the case and if you were a  suspect she wouldn't give him  information that would make it easier  for him to dodge the police and so  there's just no real way for him to get  that info and so what he basically  calculates here is the idea that the  best way to get that info is to  basically manipulate her right to use  her for his own ends to kind of pump her  for information now the funny thing is  she kind of does that to a degree but  the two of them basically end up meeting  up for lunch and once he has this  conversation with her and saying hey  look so uh so here's the thing right  there were i was asking my people to  look for any kind of discrepancies in  our import logs or anything like that  and he says 18 months ago we had a  missing shipment container that was  never accounted for and it apparently  had 25 motorcycles in it now when she  asked the question why didn't you  contact the cops he's like i mean it's  one missing container out of 2200 we're  not really that concerned about it  especially if all it had in it were  motorcycles right it's not really the a  super important thing to us if it had  like microchips that could launch  nuclear missiles across the world sure  we would probably tell someone right but  until then we didn't necessarily have a  reason to now one of the funny things is  where she kind of where she asked to ask  him the question you know hey like why  are you even coming to me and telling me  all this in the first place he's like  well i looked you up right i got curious  and i just kind of did some poking  around on you i know people who know  people they were able to give me a  little bit of background informati